                                                    <object statement-guid="ff85739f-f5e3-11ec-bcfa-090678875c1c" type="literal">     - passed parameters when calling script (-PconfluenceUser=myUsername -PconfluencePass=myPassword) which can be fetched as a secrets on CI/CD or</object>
